      "readme": "# PM-08: Primavera P6 Level 4 Logic Network & Critical Path\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 2: Planning, WBS & Master Schedule (RIBA 2-3)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 2-3`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `144 Tasks / 213 FS Links`\n- **WBS Scope**: `All WBS`\n- **Governing Standards**: AACE 27R-03 & 38R-06, 8.0 hr/day 5-day IE Calendar (880 Workdays)\n- **Focus Areas**: 48 Critical Tasks, 0 Lags, 0 Negative Float, M1000-M7060, Schedule Basis\n\n## Module Overview\nBuild deterministic FS/SS logic across Pre-Construction, OFCI, CSA Shell, MEP Halls 1-5, Energisation, and L1-L5 Commissioning.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | AACE Recommended Practice 27R-03 (Schedule Classification & CPM Method) | `PM08_Doc1_Standard_AACE_Recommended_Practice_27R_03_Rev.004.docx` | AACE 27R-03 / 38R-06 |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Master Level 4 Primavera P6 File (144 Tasks, 213 Links, 48 Critical Tasks) | `PM08_Doc2_Deliverable_Primavera_P6_Schedule_144Tasks_Master_Rev.004.xer` | EU Calendar (2027-2030) |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Project Implementation Plan (PIP) & Interactive 144-Task Gantt Workbook | `PM08_Doc3_Template_PIP_144Task_Gantt_Master_Rev.004.xlsx` | Sheet 3. 144-Task Gantt |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Schedule Basis Memorandum (Calendars, Shift Assumptions & Driving Path) | `PM08_Doc4_Audit_Schedule_Basis_Memorandum_Calendars_Rev.004.docx` | AACE 38R-06 Basis Memo |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Differentiate Level 1 executive timelines from Level 4 logic-driven execution networks.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Operate an importable P6 XER schedule driving May 2028 energisation to 2030 RFS.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Communicate P6 critical path dates and dependencies clearly in Excel to non-planners.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Document Irish bank holidays, productivity assumptions, and key critical-path drivers.\n",
