      "id": "PM-10",
      "title": "Resource Loading, Cashflow S-Curves & Baseline Controls",
      "desc": "Cost-load P6 activities to forecast monthly EUR burn rates, engineering/site manpower peaks, and Performance Measurement Baselines.",
      "tags": [
        "S-Curve",
        "PMB",
        "Manpower"
      ],
      "folder": "Phase_2_Planning_WBS_P6_RIBA_2_3\\PM-10_Resource_Loading_Cashflow_SCurves",
      "keyFacts": [
        "Time-Phased Baseline: PMB S-Curve mapped across 2027-2030 cutoffs",
        "Trades: CSA -> 110kV HV -> MEP Fitout -> Cx L1-L5 Commissioning",
        "Welfare Compliance: Turnstiles, Canteen & Drying Rooms (HSA SI 291)",
        "Logistics Window: Abnormal load routing (Ro-Ro Port -> Site)",
        "Cash Flow Link: Tranche drawdown synced to physical % earned"
      ],
      "readme": "# PM-10: Resource Loading, Cashflow S-Curves & Baseline Controls\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 2: Planning, WBS & Master Schedule (RIBA 2-3)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 2-5`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `2027-2030 Monthly Cutoffs`\n- **WBS Scope**: `WBS 1.0-7.0`\n- **Governing Standards**: PMI Cost-Loaded Schedule Standard, HSA Construction Welfare Regs\n- **Focus Areas**: EUR S-Curve, Trade Manpower Peak, CSA/HV/MEP/Cx Crews, Turnstiles & Canteen, Site Logistics\n\n## Module Overview\nCost-load P6 activities to forecast monthly EUR burn rates, engineering/site manpower peaks, and Performance Measurement Baselines.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | PMI Practice Standard for Cost-Loaded Scheduling & Cashflow Forecasting | `PM10_Doc1_Standard_PMI_Practice_Standard_for_Cost_Rev.004.docx` | PMI Practice Standard |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Performance Measurement Baseline (PMB) \u2014 Monthly EUR Capex Burn S-Curve | `PM10_Doc2_Deliverable_PMB_Monthly_Burn_SCurve_Master_Rev.004.xlsx` | Sheet 4. EVM Cost/Schedule |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Trade & Engineering Peak Manpower Histogram (CSA, HV, MEP, Cx Teams) | `PM10_Doc3_Template_Trade_Engineering_Peak_Manpower_Rev.004.xlsx` | Trade Labour Loading |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Peak Headcount Welfare, Canteen, Turnstile & Site Logistics Audit Plan | `PM10_Doc4_Audit_Peak_Headcount_Welfare_Canteen_Rev.004.xlsx` | HSA Site Welfare Regs |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Connect P6 task durations directly to capex drawdown curves and Earned Value baselines.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Forecast cumulative EUR investment pacing across enabling, CSA, MEP, and Cx phases.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Prevent trade stacking in crowded white space by forecasting peak craft headcounts.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Ensure statutory HSE welfare facilities, parking, and biometric gates scale for peak labour.\n",
