      "title": "BS EN ISO 19650 Information Management, EIR & CDE Setup",
      "desc": "Implement Common Data Environment workflows (WIP -> Shared -> Published -> Archive), Exchange Info Requirements, and BIM LOD matrices.",
      "tags": [
        "ISO 19650",
        "CDE",
        "BEP"
      ],
      "folder": "Phase_2_Planning_WBS_P6_RIBA_2_3\\PM-12_ISO19650_Information_Mgmt_CDE",
      "keyFacts": [
        "Standard: BS EN ISO 19650-1 & -2 CDE Workflow",
        "CDE Zones: WIP -> Shared (S0-S4) -> Published (A1-A7) -> Archive",
        "Core Docs: EIR (Client Req) -> BEP (Execution) -> MIDP (Delivery Matrix)",
        "Master Register: 144 Primary Docs + ISO Naming Convention",
        "LOD Milestones: LOD 350 Spatial -> LOD 400 Fabrication (IFC) -> LOD 500 As-Built"
      ],
      "readme": "# PM-12: BS EN ISO 19650 Information Management, EIR & CDE Setup\n\n- **Phase**: `Phase 2: Planning, WBS & Master Schedule (RIBA 2-3)`\n- **RIBA Stage**: `RIBA Stage 2-7`\n- **P6 Milestone Gate**: `M2110 / A7050`\n- **WBS Scope**: `All WBS`\n- **Governing Standards**: BS EN ISO 19650-1 & -2 CDE Architecture & Suitability Workflow\n- **Focus Areas**: EIR, MIDP, BEP, CDE (WIP/Shared/Pub/Arch), Codes S0-S4 / A1-A7\n\n## Module Overview\nImplement Common Data Environment workflows (WIP -> Shared -> Published -> Archive), Exchange Info Requirements, and BIM LOD matrices.\n\n## Ordered Flashcard Documents (`Doc 1` -> `Doc 4`)\n\n| Doc | Category | Title | Exact Local File | Companion / Notes |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| Doc 1 | Standard | BS EN ISO 19650-1 & -2 Information Management Concepts & Delivery Phase | `PM12_Doc1_Standard_BS_EN_ISO_19650_1_2_Information_Rev.004.docx` | BS EN ISO 19650-1 / -2 |\n| Doc 2 | Deliverable | Exchange Information Requirements (EIR) & Master Information Delivery Plan | `PM12_Doc2_Deliverable_Exchange_Information_Requirements_Rev.004.docx` | Appointing Party EIR/MIDP |\n| Doc 3 | Template | Project BIM Execution Plan (BEP) & CDE Folder Workflow (WIP/Shared/Archive) | `PM12_Doc3_Template_Project_BIM_Execution_Plan_BEP_CDE_Rev.004.xlsx` | CDE Workflow & Naming Code |\n| Doc 4 | Audit | Master Document Register (MDR) with ISO 19650 Suitability Codes (S0-A7) | `PM12_Doc4_Audit_Master_Document_Register_DC45EU_Rev.003.xlsx` | Portfolio Next Deliverable |\n\n## Study Takeaway (`Why Each Document Matters`)\n- **Doc 1 (Standard)**: Enforce uniform naming conventions and suitability gates (S0-A7) across ACC/BIM 360.\n- **Doc 2 (Deliverable)**: Define exact BIM LOD, COBie data fields, and submission dates inside vendor contracts.\n- **Doc 3 (Template)**: Standardize originator, volume, level, type, and role fields across all disciplines.\n- **Doc 4 (Audit)**: Track live drawing transmittals, review aging, and IFC approvals in one central ledger.\n",
